// ── Takuzu alias page - /binary/takuzu/ ────────────────────────────────
// Authority page for the "takuzu" keyword family (GSC positions ~8-9 for
// "takuzu" / "takuzu game"). Positioning: Takuzu = Binary Puzzle = Binairo,
// one game invented in Belgium in 2009. Links to the playable game at /binary/
// (which owns the "binary puzzle" family) instead of cannibalizing it.
// Product facts: sizes are 6×6 / 8×8 / 10×10 only. The engine lives in
// public/binary-engine.js (global BinaryEngine). We do NOT claim 14×14.
